  "description": "Samuri is a new display font with Japanese style features, developed with an exotic and relaxed shape. This font is extremely attractive to match your extraordinary project, using this font will instantly make your project look exquisite, charming, and everyone will be glad to look. Unlike the rest, your project will be one-of-a-kind.\nLogotypes, food banners, branding, brochure, posters, movie titles, book titles, quotes, and more may all benefit from this font.\nOf course, using this font in your various design projects will make them excellent and outstanding; many viewers are drawn to the striking and unusual graphic display.\nStart utilizing this typeface in your projects to make them stand out.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Samuri is a new display font with Japanese style features, developed with an exotic and relaxed shape. This font is extremely attractive to match your extraordinary project, using this font will instantly make your project look exquisite, charming, and everyone will be glad to look. Unlike the rest, your project will be one-of-a-kind.</p>\n<p>Logotypes, food banners, branding, brochure, posters, movie titles, book titles, quotes, and more may all benefit from this font.</p>\n<p>Of course, using this font in your various design projects will make them excellent and outstanding; many viewers are drawn to the striking and unusual graphic display.</p>\n<p>Start utilizing this typeface in your projects to make them stand out.</p>",
